            "notes": "## Round 1 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) here simply because of how strong this is in the tank battle. You will chew through any tank in a very short amount of time and swing the teamfight \n- Getting headshots can definitely feel inconsistent at times if you're not hitting many, but even if you swing only 1 teamfight because of it, that can be more than enough to take a round since they're so short in this mode\n- [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) also has a few meters of AOE that can swing things even further if they are playing bunched up\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for more explosion damage and healing\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for faster shooting to proc [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) \n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) to stay alive\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) can be a great option as you get similar headshot damage to [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) but also increase bodyshot damage (at the expense of healing output)\n- [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) if you're feeling spicy over [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- At this stage, everyone is almost near base levels of damage from regular 5v5 so you don't need to change too much from your normal Zen game plan",
