            "notes": "## Round 2 ##\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is a good way to start covering all bases; higher damage output, higher healing output, self-heal and overhealth\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for more explosion damage\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) can be great additional survivability if you need it; armor goes under your shields so you get the 10% damage reduction benefit often\n- [Satya's Solution](item_1710519d-210a-4b92-b9ed-234abf6ade2c) can also help getting away to survive, into the fight, and with damage output\n- From this point forward, even if it's not listed, always consider [Hiking Hoverboots](item_158611dd-147a-4375-a16a-565aa4f5f7de) if you can take advantage of it on your upcoming map\n- Depending on your needs from the previous round, pick from any of the rest of the **Optional** items to get to match your level of cash at this point\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Building [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) overhealth whenever possible will be key to surviving anyone targeting you.",
