            "notes": "## Round 3 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) has dual purpose here:\n- First, as everyone else's damage starts to scale, Zen is pretty vulnerable so picking this to stay alive is key\n- Second, even though it may be tempting to take [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) early, [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) enables you to play more aggressively with angles to get more damage and picks that way; this damage with the additional self-heal numbers pump up your cash too \n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) is a great add here to keep stacking weapon damage, headshot explosion damage, and healing; the healing benefits from ability power also count towards your [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) healing\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- If you truly were ignored in Rounds 1 and 2 and don't seem to need [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c), remove [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) until next round and take [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) + [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)\n- [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) will proc with every tick of [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) for a total of 7 seconds per discord application\n- Continue to consider [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) to reduce damage taken, and [Satya's Solution](item_1710519d-210a-4b92-b9ed-234abf6ade2c) to get away quicker if you're really getting pressured\n- If you took [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) here, also consider [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) to snag low health kills with minimal effort\n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Really lean into your newfound increase in survivability and set yourself up for success in hitting those juicy [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) headshots. Even a dropped Rein shield for 2 seconds can be enough to drop him to half and let your frontline clean up for free.",
