            "notes": "## Round 4 ##\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- Assuming you're still following the recommended Powers, I like [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) here to keep your weapon damage going up but also your healing/explosion output\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- If you took [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) + [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) last round, now you might want to grab [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) instead of [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) \n- Continue to consider [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) to reduce damage taken, and [Satya's Solution](item_1710519d-210a-4b92-b9ed-234abf6ade2c) to get away quicker if you're really getting pressured\n- I've even been taking [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) over [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) for this round sometimes just to help with the ability to safely poke when there's a tough ranged DPS always taking shots at poor [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317), definitely worth consideration\n- Again, If you took [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) last Round, also consider [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) to snag low health kills with minimal effort\n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Keep going for those juicy [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) headshots while staying as safe as you need to",
