            "notes": "## Round 5 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) can finally shine if you're following the recommended Powers\n- It does *not* do that much damage, but similar to Ashe dynamite, it can get kills from around corners, take out low health targets, make flankers have to back up even after some missed regular left-click shots from you, etc.\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- As mentioned previously, [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) will proc with every tick of [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) for a total of 7 seconds per discord application\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- With the massive amounts of damage you can be putting out at this point, [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) could be doing respectable healing for a Zen at this point if that's more your playstyle, but  [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) + [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) *should* get more value typically\n- Consider [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) on top of the [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) in place of what you can afford if you're getting hard focused by a good dive team and need to stay alive at all costs\n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Now that you can apply [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) nearly at will with every Discord Orb placement, use this as often as you can to bait out cleanses like Suzu and Bubble, while also dictating who wins a typically even match up",
