            "notes": "## Round 6 ##\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- I like [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) here to really keep your opportunity for headshots as high as possible\n- The only downside to [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) is that if you click Discord Orb and left-click at the exact same time, the first headshot will go faster than the Discord Orb and not get the explosio; consider any **Optional** items as usual\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- If you're getting consistent value out of [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) at this point, or especially if you've been missing headshots, you should may want to add on [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) before [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3), especially if you *or* the enemy team has a short range teammate like [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)\n- Consider [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) and even [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) in place of what you can afford if you're getting hard focused by a good dive team and need to stay alive at all costs\n- [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) actually procs off of [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) so this is also a good damage option at this point in the game now that you likely have [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) \n- Depending on how the previous rounds went, pick from any of the **Optional** items; whether you have extra money and are adding something, or are swapping some out due to your current needs and cash flow, get what you need\n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- If you aren't getting focused, your damage should be pretty insane at this point; really focus anything that you can hit consistent headshots on or anyone brave enough to push you, while keeping up the [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)",
