            "notes": "## Round 7 ##\n---\n### \u26a1 Powers: ###\n- [Circle of Strife](item_f004a339-4ad2-41c6-bda2-addf1222f151) isn't going to kill everyone instantly or anything but it really can take over fights with your ult if you don't sit on it too long\n- Another Power like [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is a great option and could give you more consistency in being able to peek corners when you normally shouldn't to play more aggressive, but *usually* when you make it to a **Round 7**, you're going to want to make the big plays with [Circle of Strife](item_f004a339-4ad2-41c6-bda2-addf1222f151) rather than another few percentages more of *safe aggression*\n---\n### \ud83d\udca3 Items: ###\n- Depending on your needs at this stage, any of the **Optional** purple items will be huge here if you can afford it but [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) or [Satya's Solution](item_1710519d-210a-4b92-b9ed-234abf6ade2c) work great if you're a bit short on cash\n---\n### \u2699\ufe0f Optional: ###\n- If you've really been missing headshots the last couple rounds, you should may want to add on [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) over any recent item; this can also really slow down someone like  a [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)\n- [Mind Shaper](item_c902b4f2-1151-4ec8-8dcd-f55144a45eb7) and [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) can add to the power of [Circle of Strife](item_f004a339-4ad2-41c6-bda2-addf1222f151) \n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) for all out damage\n- After lots of testing, [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) can only activate on [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317) if you also choose [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) (the active ability from that makes it proc, not orbs); this is also an option if you replace [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) \n---\n### \ud83c\udfae Playstyle: ###\n- Let it fly! Utilize all of your previous pickups, as well as the additional benefits from [Circle of Strife](item_f004a339-4ad2-41c6-bda2-addf1222f151) to take your Round 7. Good luck out there!",
